<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ share_title }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f5f7;
    --fg: #1a1a1a;
    --muted: #6b6b6b;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --border: #e2e2e7;
    --row-hover: #fafafa;
    --billable: #c0392b;
    --watch: #d68910;
    --ok: #1e8449;
    --trend-up-bg: #fecaca;
    --trend-up-fg: #991b1b;
    --trend-down-bg: #bbf7d0;
    --trend-down-fg: #166534;
    --trend-flat-bg: #e5e7eb;
    --trend-flat-fg: #4b5563;
    --tab-active: #1a1a1a;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  main { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 48px; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .card .label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .card .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .card.danger .value { color: var(--billable); }
  h2.section {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .env-tabs { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .env-tabs input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .tab-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .tab-bar label {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    margin-bottom: -1px;
    background: transparent;
  }
  #tab-prod:checked ~ .tab-bar label[for="tab-prod"],
  #tab-dev:checked ~ .tab-bar label[for="tab-dev"] {
    color: var(--tab-active);
    background: var(--card);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .tab-panel { display: none; }
  #tab-prod:checked ~ .panel-prod { display: block; }
  #tab-dev:checked ~ .panel-dev { display: block; }
  .table-wrap {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: var(--card);
  }
  #tab-prod:checked ~ .panel-prod .table-wrap { border-top-left-radius: 0; }
  #tab-dev:checked ~ .panel-dev .table-wrap { border-top-left-radius: 8px; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  th {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    background: #fafafb;
  }
  .th-sub {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #999;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tr:hover td { background: var(--row-hover); }
  tr.row-billable td { background: #fff9f9; }
  tr.row-billable .cost { font-weight: 600; color: var(--billable); }
  .num { text-align: right; }
  .status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: normal;
    min-width: 200px;
  }
  .status-dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .status-dot.billable { background: var(--billable); }
  .status-dot.watch { background: var(--watch); }
  .status-dot.ok { background: var(--ok); }
  .status-dot.na { background: #ccc; }
  .trend-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .trend-badge.up { background: var(--trend-up-bg); color: var(--trend-up-fg); border-color: #f87171; }
  .trend-badge.down { background: var(--trend-down-bg); color: var(--trend-down-fg); border-color: #4ade80; }
  .trend-badge.flat { background: var(--trend-flat-bg); color: var(--trend-flat-fg); border-color: #d1d5db; }
  .trend-badge.none { color: var(--muted); background: transparent; font-weight: 400; }
  .err { color: var(--billable); font-size: 12px; }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .footnote a { color: #2563eb; }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .card { break-inside: avoid; }
    .tab-panel { display: block !important; page-break-before: always; }
    .tab-panel:first-of-type { page-break-before: auto; }
    .tab-bar { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>{{ share_title }}</h1>
  <p class="meta">Generated {{ generated_at }} · {{ days }}-day window · <code>FetchRemoteConfig</code> client fetches</p>

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card{% if total_monthly > 0 %} danger{% endif %}">
      <div class="label">Projected Blaze overage / month (prod)</div>
      <div class="value">${{ "%.2f"|format(total_monthly) }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">Billable prod projects</div>
      <div class="value">{{ billable_count }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="label">Free tier (daily)</div>
      <div class="value">{{ "{:,}".format(daily_free) }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section">Cost impact — your apps</h2>

  <div class="env-tabs">
    <input type="radio" name="env-tab" id="tab-prod" checked>
    <input type="radio" name="env-tab" id="tab-dev">
    <div class="tab-bar">
      <label for="tab-prod">Prod</label>
      <label for="tab-dev">Dev</label>
    </div>

    {% macro render_table(env_rows) %}
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Project</th>
            <th class="num">Avg fetches/day<span class="th-sub">last {{ days }} days</span></th>
            <th class="num">Projected $/mo</th>
            <th>Status</th>
            <th class="num">Peak/day<span class="th-sub">in window</span></th>
            <th>Trend<span class="th-sub">{{ trend_label }}</span></th>
            {% if has_amplitude %}
            <th class="num">MAU<span class="th-sub">latest month</span></th>
            <th class="num">Fetches/user/day<span class="th-sub">avg ÷ MAU</span></th>
            {% endif %}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for r in env_rows %}
          <tr class="{% if r.status_tier == 'billable' %}row-billable{% endif %}">
            <td>{{ r.friendly_name }}</td>
            {% if r.error %}
            <td colspan="{{ 5 if not has_amplitude else 7 }}" class="err">{{ r.error }} ({{ r.project_id }})</td>
            {% elif r.avg_daily is none %}
            <td colspan="{{ 5 if not has_amplitude else 7 }}" class="err">No fetch data ({{ r.project_id }})</td>
            {% else %}
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.avg_daily) }}</td>
            <td class="num cost">${{ "%.2f"|format(r.est_monthly_cost) }}</td>
            <td>
              <div class="status">
                <span class="status-dot {{ r.status_tier }}"></span>
                <span>{{ r.status_label }}</span>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.peak_daily) }}</td>
            <td>
              <span class="trend-badge {{ r.trend_kind }}">{{ r.trend }}</span>
            </td>
            {% if has_amplitude %}
            <td class="num">{{ "{:,}".format(r.mau) if r.mau is not none else '—' }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.fetches_per_user_per_day) if r.fetches_per_user_per_day is not none else '—' }}</td>
            {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    {% endmacro %}

    {% set prod_rows = rows | selectattr('env', 'equalto', 'prod') | list %}
    {% set dev_rows = rows | selectattr('env', 'equalto', 'dev') | list %}

    <div class="tab-panel panel-prod">
      {{ render_table(prod_rows) }}
    </div>
    <div class="tab-panel panel-dev">
      {{ render_table(dev_rows) }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="footnote">
    Sorted by avg daily fetches (high → low) within each tab. Avg and projected cost use the last {{ days }} days.
    Trend compares {{ trend_label }} (or half-window if sparse):
    <span class="trend-badge up">Up</span> = more fetches (cost risk),
    <span class="trend-badge down">Down</span> = fewer fetches,
    <span class="trend-badge flat">Flat</span> = stable.
    Status <strong>watch</strong> on prod = ≥{{ warn_peak_pct|int }}% of {{ "{:,}".format(daily_free) }}/day free tier.
    Pricing: <a href="https://firebase.google.com/docs/remote-config/pricing">Firebase Remote Config (Blaze)</a>.
    {% if has_amplitude %}
    <br><br>
    <strong>MAU</strong> = monthly active users from Amplitude (latest available month in window).
    <strong>Fetches/user/day</strong> = avg daily fetches ÷ MAU. ~1.0 is healthy (one fetch per active user per day);
    values well above 1 suggest over-fetching, missing client-side cache, or a retry loop.
    Apps without Amplitude coverage show "—".
    {% endif %}
  </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
